  "worked_solution": "In the model, we have $\\frac{1}{2}$ multiplied by $2.$ This means that we need to make $2$ copies of the given fraction model.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129500/assets/73f10208823f0a218c48d74b5f394f1fc6621bf2f5e6ebabdb7aa99cd1256ccb.png)\n\n \n\nSo, the missing picture is:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129500/assets/11b494aa487b6ff2bcc449b40f904071ec0845df4165c2f780626fc51045b233.png)",
